WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.067
Times tables to 10 × 10

2
00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:10.667
At the market, eggs are sold in boxes. Each box holds six eggs.

3
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:16.500
One box is six, two boxes are twelve, three boxes are eighteen.

4
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.200
We skip count in sixes.

5
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.300
Seven boxes: seven times six is forty-two.

6
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:28.033
Six times seven is forty-two too.
